# Keep the build context small and avoid copying host-specific/stale artifacts
# (especially node_modules and .venv - copying either in would shadow the
# clean install the Dockerfile does, exactly like the stale vite.config.js
# incident this project already hit once).
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
.vscode
.idea
*.log
tmp/
temp_exports/
output/
*.stl
*.3mf
*.zip
.DS_Store
